    "body": "Nope, they all work. If they don't for you, it's either a temporary problem, or a you-problem. \n\nALL TRACKERS WERE ACTIVE IN UTORRENT OR I WOULDN'T HAVE COPIED THEM.\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenBitTorrent is often up and down and currently indeed reports as down again. But it was UP when I posted this. Otherwise I wouldn't copy it. \n\nALL my trackers were collected and added in september (and before). A few days ago I fired up my utorrent because I was testing a new torrent program. That's when I took a popular old torrent, loaded all trackers and watched for the ones that connected. Those were copied here to github. nothing else. \n\nBonus: DHT Bootstrap Nodes:\ndht.aelitis.com:6881\nrouter.bittorrent.com:6881\ndht.transmissionbt.com:6881\nbootstrap.jami.net:4222",
